title: Ernest_Day1
tags: #solo
---
Ernest: I wonder if that story was really true…
===

title: Ernest_CantSneakYet
tags: #solo
---
Ernest: The forest is out of bounds, I can't just walk out right in front of the teacher!
===

title: Ernest_SneakingOut
tags: #solo
---
Ernest: I don't care if the forest is out of bounds. There's no way I can just leave without seeing what's through there for myself. 
Ernest: I need to find a way to sneak past the teachers. If they see me, I'll never make it out. 
<<set $triggerSneakOut = true>>
<<set $campfireDay2 = true>>
===

title: Ernest_Intro
tags: #solo
---
Ernest: I can walk around camp (use WASD), I can check my diary to see what tasks I have to do today (press Q), and I can interact (press E) with my classmates and teachers.
Ernest: I think my tent is the green one!
===

title: Ernest_SneakingPrompt
tags: #solo
---
Ernest: I need to get out of the teacher's sight.
===

title: Ernest_Day3Sneaking
